# CVE-2026-50163: oras-go tar extraction - hardlink Linkname path traversal
# (oras.land/oras-go/v2, all versions through v2.6.1, no upstream fix available)
#
# This CVE affects the content/file store, which performs tar extraction to the
# local filesystem. metalman uses only content/oci (a raw OCI layout blob store)
# and delegates layer unpacking to umoci. The vulnerable tar extraction code
# path in content/file is never invoked by this binary.
CVE-2026-50163
